eholders service such as non-payment of dividend, delay in share transfer etc. PART B: COMPLIANCE CERTIFICATE [See Regulation 17(8) and Regulation 62D(14)] The following compliance certificate shall be furnished by chief executive officer and chief financial officer: A. They have reviewed financial statements and the cash flow statement for the year and that to the best of their knowledge and belief:
